111","email":"tcarpenter@postregister.com","website":"https://fibercaredallas.com/","domain":"fibercaredallas.com","google_maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJZfULII2dToYRvu4kWM3Wgvs","rating":5,"review_count":24,"reviews_id":"-3.234600457817992e+17","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEsK8hfXnl7m2rv5-OCD9N2vlHilQ08RQlzG4KQrzPAFy_Dm1ZVLn3Me4srMX_vLkQwtbHKblGC1xEPf_LGy5x0IKgHl_Xn92bSFSqeBEJ5gtz1Jj5uILhR5uAGNQbFL0efHCcl2PCKBbib=w800-h500-k-no","owner_id":"1.0271057144838655e+20","owner_title":"FiberCare Cleaning and Storage, LLC","business_status":"OPERATIONAL","working_hours":"Monday,8AM,5PM|Tuesday,8AM,5PM|Wednesday,8AM,5PM|Thursday,8AM,5PM|Friday,8AM,5PM|Saturday,9AM,12PM","source":"https://fibercaredallas.com/about-fiber-care/","company_linkedin":null,"company_facebook":"http://www.facebook.com/fibercareinc","company_instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/fibercaredallas","company_twitter":"https://twitter.com/JimBlackRealtor","company_youtube":null,"full_name":null,"first_name":null,"last_name":null,"title":null,"contact_phone":null,"contact_linkedin":null,"website_title":"Home - FiberCare Cleaning and Storage","website_description":"FiberCare Dallas specializes in caring for fine fabrics. For your home we offer long lasting fabric protection and cleaning services for upholstery, draperies, rugs and carpet. For your commercial use we offer a variety of finishes by the yard, including flame proofing, protection, backing and lamination. FiberCare and The Cleaning Company work together to keep your fine furniture, draperies, rugs and carpet cleaned and protected. FiberCare is an invisible, long-lasting finish that protects against spots, stains and spills. The Cleaning Company specializes in a custom hand cleaning of fine fabrics, rugs and draperies. We are located in Dallas, Texas.","website_generator":"Powered by LayerSlider 7.2.1 - Multi-Purpose, Responsive, Parallax, Mobile-Friendly Slider Plugin for WordPress.","web